      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\int_a^b f(x)dx=\\left.F(x)\\right|_a^b=F(b)-F(a)$",
        "以及　$\\int_a^b f(t)dt=\\left.F(t)\\right|_a^b=F(b)-F(a)$ 等等，",
        "就是说，得到的是同一个数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在我们来讨论具有可变积分上限的积分（我们用字母",
        "$x$ 表示可变的积分上限，而用字母 $t$ 表示积分变量）：",
        "$\\int_a^x f(t)dt$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这个积分是 $x$ 的函数。我们来证明，这个函数的导数",
        "$\\left(\\int_a^x f(t)dt\\right)'=f(x)$。　（1）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "实际上，根据牛顿-莱布尼兹公式：",
        "$\\int_a^x f(t)dt=F(x)-F(a)$，",
        "因此",
        "$\\left(\\int_a^x f(t)dt\\right)'=[F(x)-F(a)]'=F'(x)-[F(a)]'=f(x)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由牛顿-莱布尼兹公式得出：",
        "$\\int_a^a f(t)dt=F(a)-F(a)=0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "所以由 $a$ 到 $x$ 的积分",
        "$F(x)=\\int_a^x f(t)dt$",
        "是函数 $f$ 的原函数，它在 $a$ 点变成零。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在 $a$ 点取值为 $q$ 的原函数可写成",
        "$q+\\int_a^x f(t)dt$。　（2）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
